  %% status-change table too, or do the two reversal shapes stay different?
  %% As drawn, in_house --> cancelled abandons the Stay while departed --> in_house
  %% returns it: two different answers to the same question.
  %% OPEN: nothing reaches reserved. Either a command is missing or the value is,
  %% and this design does not decide which.
